            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mimomama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used whole peeled canned tomatoes in place of the raw Roma. And, for the onions, I stewed them in the juice separately until almost transparent, before adding in the sliced tomatoes. This method cuts down time for me, and I enjoyed this treat. This was a nice variation. Thanks!"
          },
