            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This one was hard for me to rate. I thought it was ok tasting, but I feel that it was too much work (peeling, seeding the tomatoes) for just an ok result, IMO. I do think that I prefer Italian-style stewed tomatoes over these, but that's just a matter of opinion also. I've never made my own stewed tomatoes, so this was fun to try. Just to be clear, the flavors were ok, I just prefer the other version...Thanks for sharing. :)",
